=Generator=
{{img:units/Generator.png}}
*  Health: 8
*  Price: %Minerals% 40
*  [[concepts/sensory|Scanning range]]: 2
*  Consumes: %Fuel%10
*  Produces: %Energy%20
Enabled generators provide energy for the local compound. Since many structures consume %Energy% when enabled, generators are a crucial component of any active base. Combine with reactor cores for increased output.
